[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800400_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800400_01_0010","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800400_01_0020","text":"……你好呀\n你从哪里来的……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800400_01_0030","text":"…………雾子？怎么了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800400_01_0040","text":"啊……\n桌子上……有只蚂蚁……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800400_01_0050","text":"诶，蚂蚁……！\n————哎呀，还真是"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800400_01_0060","text":"……抱歉啊，小蚂蚁\n这里可不是你的餐桌哦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800400_01_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800400_01_0062","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800400_01_0070","text":"谢谢你……\n帮我……放它走了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800400_01_0080","text":"嗯？……啊，没什么\n我也不能把它踩死嘛，小小的生命也很珍贵"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800400_01_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800400_01_0082","text":"店员"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800400_01_0090","text":"————让您久等了\n这是煎猪排和烤鸡肉"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800400_01_0100","text":"啊，好的────"}]
